    {"problem": "The house feels clammy even with the AC running", "solution": "An oversized air conditioner cools the air fast and shuts off before it pulls the moisture out. We size from a heat-gain calculation and favour inverter or variable-speed equipment that runs longer at low speed, which dries the air as it cools."},
    {"problem": "The outdoor unit is rusting well before its time", "solution": "Moisture, wind-blown grit and a unit sitting in a puddle all speed up wear. We set equipment on a raised stand or wall bracket, use corrosion-resistant mounting hardware, and rinse the coil at every tune-up."},
